 "text": "Services | Ramsey County, ND\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nHow Do I...\nGovernment\nResidents\nDepartments\nServices\n-->\nHome\nServices\nServices\n9\n1\n1\n2\nAlerts\nSign up to receive announcements of important information (e.g., warnings of natural disasters) sent to you through email or text message.\nCounty Links\nAccess a list of sites to area resources including area colleges, corporations, publications, and more.\nEmployment\nView open positions and fill out available applications.\nFlag Disposal\nInformation on a partnership to provide a proper disposal service for US flags.\nOnline Payments\nView available bills to be paid online.\nRequest for Proposals\nRamsey County is soliciting proposals from professional and experienced consulting planning firms.\nTax Forfeited Property\nRead the chapter on real estate forfeited to the county for delinquent taxes and the terms of annual sale.\nVote By Mail\nRamsey County will be conducting elections through the mail, here are the basics of what you need to know about all-mail elections.\nAlert Center\nThere are no alerts at this time.\nCalendar\nTue, Oct. 20\nRamsey County Regular Commission Meeting\nTue, Nov. 3\nElection Day\nFri, Nov. 6\nRamsey County Regular Commission Meeting\nView All Events\n/Calendar.aspx\nAlerts\nCounty Links\nEmployment\nFlag Disposal\nOnline Payments\nRequest for Proposals\nTax Forfeited Property\nTax Oath\nVote By Mail\nAgendas & Minutes Online Agenda Center\nParcel Viewer Online GIS Mapping\nMeeting Videos View Posted Recordings\nSign up for Alerts Hyper-reach Regional Notifications\nOnline Property Tax Payment Methods & Instructions\nSheriff Department Contact Your Sheriff's Dept.\n-->\nContact Us\n524 4th Avenue NE\nDevils Lake, ND 58301\nSocial\nFacebook\nYouTube\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGover